      "hook": "A thug sneers 'We're clearing this rubbish' while holding uprooted medicinal plants, then crushes them in the mud.",
      "cliffhanger": "Juliana screams 'Stop!' as a thug raises a heavy club to strike her down.",
      "why": "Starts with immediate cruelty and destruction of something precious, escalating to a life-threatening threat before any rescue.",
      "context_gap": "None; the viewer understands the villain is destroying the heroine's home and she is helpless."
